@GatewayService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5027

### Auctions via gateway
GET {{GatewayService_HostAddress}}/api/auctions
Accept: application/json

### Auction by id via gateway
GET {{GatewayService_HostAddress}}/api/auctions/c3a1f4d2-8b6e-4c91-9f20-1a7b5e3d8c44
Accept: application/json

### Search via gateway
GET {{GatewayService_HostAddress}}/api/search
Accept: application/json

### Search with filters via gateway
GET {{GatewayService_HostAddress}}/api/search?club=Barcelona&status=Live
Accept: application/json

